{"seq":2,"slug":"structuring-smurf-detect","title":"结构化拆分（Smurfing）检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/aml-scenario-rule/structuring-smurf-detect","wordCount":2321,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构化拆分-smurfing-检测\">结构化拆分（Smurfing）检测</h1><p>结构化拆分是反洗钱监控中最经典的一类手法：把一笔大额资金拆成多笔低于申报阈值的小额交易，从而规避大额交易报告义务。它之所以经典，是因为它的<strong>判定条件天然清晰</strong>——阈值是法定的、明确的数字，不需要主观判断。但清晰不等于容易实现，恰恰相反，它是所有规则里误报率最高的之一，因为&quot;多笔小额&quot;在正常商业行为中极其常见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构化拆分的定义可以概括为：<strong>在监管申报阈值附近，出现刻意规避该阈值的交易聚集</strong>。定义里有三个要素，每个都有实现难点。</p>\n<p>第一个要素是<strong>阈值</strong>。阈值不是一个固定数字，而是一组：不同币种、不同渠道、不同司法辖区可能有不同的申报门槛；跨境与境内门槛不同；现金与转账门槛不同。系统必须维护一个<strong>阈值注册表</strong>，而不是把 10000 这个数字散落在代码里。</p>\n<p>第二个要素是<strong>聚集</strong>。拆分必然表现为数量上的聚集，而聚集必须在窗口内度量。窗口长度是设计参数：太短会漏掉慢速拆分（每天存一笔，连续两周），太长会引入大量噪音。</p>\n<p>第三个要素是<strong>刻意</strong>。这是最难的——单凭金额模式无法区分&quot;刻意规避&quot;和&quot;恰好分成几笔&quot;。工程上的做法是引入<strong>辅助信号</strong>增强判别力：账户是否为新开、交易是否集中在阈值下方一个很窄的带内、是否使用了多个自身无法解释的账户或渠道、时间间隔是否过于规律。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[交易事件流] --&gt; B{金额落在&lt;br/&gt;阈值带内?}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; Z[交给其他规则]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[累加账户窗口计数&lt;br/&gt;与金额]&#10;  C --&gt; D{计数 &gt;= N&lt;br/&gt;且 窗口内累计 &gt;= 阈值?}&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; Z&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; E[计算增强信号分]&#10;  E --&gt; F{分散度 / 规律性&lt;br/&gt;/ 账户年龄 满足?}&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; G[低优先级警报]&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; H[高优先级警报&lt;br/&gt;附证据快照]\">flowchart TD\n  A[交易事件流] --&gt; B{金额落在&lt;br/&gt;阈值带内?}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; Z[交给其他规则]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[累加账户窗口计数&lt;br/&gt;与金额]\n  C --&gt; D{计数 &gt;= N&lt;br/&gt;且 窗口内累计 &gt;= 阈值?}\n  D -- 否 --&gt; Z\n  D -- 是 --&gt; E[计算增强信号分]\n  E --&gt; F{分散度 / 规律性&lt;br/&gt;/ 账户年龄 满足?}\n  F -- 否 --&gt; G[低优先级警报]\n  F -- 是 --&gt; H[高优先级警报&lt;br/&gt;附证据快照]</pre><h2 id=\"阈值带的数学定义与参数选择\">阈值带的数学定义与参数选择</h2><h3 id=\"阈值带的构造\">阈值带的构造</h3><p>设监管申报阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，则&quot;阈值带&quot;通常定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\,T(1-b),\\; T\\,)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是带宽参数，常见取值 0.05 至 0.10。也就是说，落在阈值下方 5% 至 10% 区间内的交易被纳入观察。</p>\n<p>带的选择直接决定误报量。带宽越大，覆盖越全，但正常交易落入的概率也线性上升。一个实用的校准方法是：用历史数据统计所有金额的分布，观察阈值带内交易占比。如果这个占比在正常客户群体中也高于总体分布的若干倍，说明这个带太宽，或者本地商业习惯本身就聚集在某个金额（例如很多商户习惯把单价定为 9999），此时应按行业分别设置带宽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"聚集度量\">聚集度量</h3><p>窗口内的聚集有三种度量方式，各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>弱点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计数型</td>\n<td>窗口内落带笔数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>快速连续拆分</td>\n<td>对慢速拆分失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累计型</td>\n<td>窗口内落带金额之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>覆盖慢速拆分</td>\n<td>需要长窗口，状态开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比率型</td>\n<td>落带金额 / 总入账金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>识别单一来源账户</td>\n<td>对高频小额的正常账户误报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上通常三者组合：计数型作为实时触发器（成本低），累计型作为准实时复核（窗口长），比率型作为案件升级时的解释性证据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滚动窗口的实现\">滚动窗口的实现</h3><p>固定窗口（自然日/自然月）实现简单但有一个致命缺陷：<strong>边界效应</strong>。攻击者只要在窗口边界两侧各放一半，就能让两个窗口都不触发。滚动窗口消除了这个漏洞，代价是需要为每个事件维护窗口内的历史。</p>\n<p>实现上有两条路线。第一条是<strong>事件时间滚动窗口 + 状态存储</strong>：为每个账户维护一个滑动的事件列表或环形缓冲，超期事件淘汰。第二条是<strong>分桶近似</strong>：把窗口切成若干桶，桶内预聚合，查询时合并相邻桶并回溯窗口起点对应的桶内部分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 滚动 24 小时窗口内的落带交易聚合（准实时复核路径使用）&#10;WITH band_txns AS (&#10;  SELECT account_id,&#10;         booked_at,&#10;         amount_cny_minor,&#10;         SUM(amount_cny_minor) OVER (&#10;           PARTITION BY account_id&#10;           ORDER BY booked_at&#10;           RANGE BETWEEN INTERVAL &#39;24 hours&#39; PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;         ) AS win_sum_24h,&#10;         COUNT(*) OVER (&#10;           PARTITION BY account_id&#10;           ORDER BY booked_at&#10;           RANGE BETWEEN INTERVAL &#39;24 hours&#39; PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;         ) AS win_cnt_24h&#10;  FROM aml_txn_fact&#10;  WHERE direction = -1                                   -- 出账方向&#10;    AND amount_cny_minor &gt;= :threshold_minor * :band_lo  -- 落带下界&#10;    AND amount_cny_minor &lt;  :threshold_minor            -- 落带上界（不含）&#10;)&#10;SELECT account_id,&#10;       MAX(win_sum_24h) AS peak_sum,&#10;       MAX(win_cnt_24h) AS peak_cnt,&#10;       COUNT(*)         AS band_hits&#10;FROM band_txns&#10;GROUP BY account_id&#10;HAVING MAX(win_cnt_24h) &gt;= :min_count&#10;    OR MAX(win_sum_24h) &gt;= :threshold_minor;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 滚动 24 小时窗口内的落带交易聚合（准实时复核路径使用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_txns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         booked_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         amount_cny_minor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_cny_minor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> booked_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win_sum_24h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> booked_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win_cnt_24h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aml_txn_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                   -- 出账方向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_cny_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :threshold_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :band_lo  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 落带下界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_cny_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  :threshold_minor            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 落带上界（不含）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win_sum_24h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak_sum,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win_cnt_24h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_hits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> band_txns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win_cnt_24h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :min_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win_sum_24h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :threshold_minor;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>RANGE BETWEEN INTERVAL &#39;24 hours&#39; PRECEDING</code> 与 <code>ROWS BETWEEN 23 PRECEDING</code> 的区别：前者按时间真正滚动，后者按行数，在事件不规则到达时两者结果完全不同。结构化拆分必须用前者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多账户与多渠道拆分\">多账户与多渠道拆分</h2><p>单一账户的拆分很容易被上述规则捕获，因此真实的拆分往往跨账户。三种典型形态：</p>\n<p><strong>同人多账户</strong>：同一自然人或其控制的多个账户分散存入。识别依赖关系数据——相同的绑定手机、相同的设备指纹、相同的收款方集合、相同的地理位置。这类特征不在账户维度上，而在实体维度上，因此需要在聚合前先做<strong>实体解析</strong>（entity resolution），把多个账户映射到同一个&quot;行为主体&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>多主体协同</strong>：多个看似无关的人在短时间内向同一收款方或同一批收款方转账。这需要对手方网络特征，属于第 2 章的内容，本文只说明它是拆分检测在图维度上的延伸。</p>\n<p><strong>多渠道分散</strong>：同一资金通过柜面、ATM、移动端、第三方支付多个渠道注入。渠道字段必须保留原始值，不能在上游归并成&quot;线下/线上&quot;——归并会直接摧毁这类检测能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;AML-STRUCT-002&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name_zh&quot;: &quot;跨渠道结构化拆分&quot;,&#10;  &quot;window&quot;: &quot;P1D&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aggregation_key&quot;: &quot;entity_id&quot;,&#10;  &quot;conditions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;amount_cny_minor&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in_band&quot;, &quot;lo_ref&quot;: &quot;threshold*(1-band)&quot;, &quot;hi_ref&quot;: &quot;threshold&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;channel_family&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;distinct_count&quot;, &quot;gte&quot;: 3 },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;band_hit_count&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gte&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 5 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;entity_resolution&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;keys&quot;: [&quot;phone_hash&quot;, &quot;device_id&quot;, &quot;settlement_account&quot;],&#10;    &quot;min_keys_match&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;validity_days&quot;: 90&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;  &quot;suppress_when&quot;: [&quot;verified_payroll_batch&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AML-STRUCT-002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name_zh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"跨渠道结构化拆分\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P1D\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aggregation_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cny_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lo_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"threshold*(1-band)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hi_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel_family\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distinct_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band_hit_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entity_resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"keys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"phone_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"device_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settlement_account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_keys_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"validity_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suppress_when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"verified_payroll_batch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entity_resolution</code> 段是这类规则与单账户规则最大的结构差异：它声明了&quot;什么算同一个人&quot;。<code>min_keys_match: 2</code> 是防止单键误合并的护栏——只用手机号合并会把家庭共享号码的成员错误地算成同一主体。<code>suppress_when</code> 则给出了白名单钩子，用于已知的批量发薪等场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抑制与白名单\">抑制与白名单</h2><p>结构化拆分的误报主要来自三类正常业务：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>批量代发</strong>：企业向大量员工发放薪资，金额相近且集中在某个范围。特征是付款方为同一企业、收款方高度分散、周期规律（月度），应通过白名单抑制。</li>\n<li><strong>零售归集</strong>：连锁门店将每日营业款上缴总部，表现为多个网点向同一账户的小额汇入。特征是渠道固定、时间规律、金额与经营规模相符。</li>\n<li><strong>分期还款</strong>：客户按计划分批偿还贷款，金额与合同约定一致。特征是存在对应的信贷合同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>白名单的设计原则是<strong>可审计</strong>：每一条白名单必须有申请人、审批人、生效期与到期日，且必须在警报中留痕说明&quot;本条警报因白名单 X 被抑制&quot;。把白名单做成一个静默的过滤表是监管检查中的常见扣分点，因为它无法证明抑制决策是经过判断的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抑制的边界\">抑制的边界</h3><p>需要警惕白名单被滥用为&quot;消音器&quot;。一个健康的做法是给白名单设置<strong>命中率上限</strong>：如果某条白名单的抑制量在某周期内超过了阈值，触发复核——它可能被扩大到了不该覆盖的范围。同时，抑制不等于不记录：被抑制的交易仍然要落库，只是在警报生成阶段降级而非丢弃，这样事后回溯时仍能重建完整视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效果度量\">效果度量</h2><p>拆分检测这类高误报规则必须持续度量，否则会缓慢退化成噪音源。关键指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确率</td>\n<td>升级为案件的警报 / 总警报</td>\n<td>需要人工标注，通常 5%–20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>被检测的拆分案例 / 已知案例总数</td>\n<td>从监管反馈与自查案例反推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位警报调查成本</td>\n<td>调查总工时 / 警报数</td>\n<td>越低越好，但不可压到零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值带命中率</td>\n<td>落带交易占比</td>\n<td>显著高于总体分布才有效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>精确率低但覆盖率高的规则不应被删除——它可能承载监管明确要求的场景。正确的处理是<strong>分层</strong>：保留规则但降低默认优先级，仅在叠加了增强信号时升级。这一治理逻辑详见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/alert-tuning-false-positive\">规则调优与误报治理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>结构化拆分的三要素是阈值、聚集、刻意；阈值必须是注册表驱动的多值集，聚集必须用事件时间滚动窗口，刻意需要增强信号而非单靠金额模式。</li>\n<li>滚动窗口优于固定窗口，因为固定窗口有边界效应；SQL 中必须用 <code>RANGE BETWEEN INTERVAL</code> 而非 <code>ROWS BETWEEN</code>。</li>\n<li>跨账户拆分需要先做实体解析，实体解析的合并键必须有最小匹配数护栏，否则会引入系统性误合并。</li>\n<li>白名单必须可审计、有到期日、留痕，并设置抑制量上限以防退化成消音器。</li>\n<li>高误报规则的处理方式是分层降优先级，而不是删除；删除会直接损伤监管要求的覆盖率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关：类型学分类框架见 <a href=\"../aml-scenario-rule/ml-typology-stage\">洗钱三阶段与典型 typology</a>；阈值与规则的组织方式见 <a href=\"../aml-scenario-rule/aml-rule-library\">监控规则库与阈值配置</a>；这类规则的实时执行路径见 <a href=\"../realtime-screening-engine/transaction-realtime-screen\">实时交易筛查管道</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结构化拆分（Smurfing）检测","id":"结构化拆分-smurfing-检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值带的数学定义与参数选择","id":"阈值带的数学定义与参数选择"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值带的构造","id":"阈值带的构造"},{"level":3,"text":"聚集度量","id":"聚集度量"},{"level":3,"text":"滚动窗口的实现","id":"滚动窗口的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"多账户与多渠道拆分","id":"多账户与多渠道拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"抑制与白名单","id":"抑制与白名单"},{"level":3,"text":"抑制的边界","id":"抑制的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"效果度量","id":"效果度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"洗钱三阶段与典型 typology","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/aml-scenario-rule/ml-typology-stage"},"next":{"title":"监控规则库与阈值配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/aml-scenario-rule/aml-rule-library"}}